| `initial_instance_count=1`                   | Starts **1 instance** for the endpoint                                             |
| `endpoint_name="insurance-charge-endpoint4"` | Gives your endpoint a custom name                                                  |
| `predictor`                                  | Stores the deployed endpoint object, which you can use to send prediction requests |


