====

AWS will:

Take your trained model.tar.gz from S3.
Use your inference.py file for prediction logic.
Create a SageMaker model.
Create the required endpoint configuration.
Launch one ml.m5.large instance.
Deploy the model.
Create the live endpoint named:
insurance-charge-endpoint4

After deployment, you can use:

predictor.predict(...)

to send new insurance customer data and receive a predicted insurance charge.

⚠️ Important: A deployed SageMaker real-time endpoint can continue generating AWS charges while it is running. Delete the endpoint when you finish testing.

